s for specified cleaning stage. Indulge in some relaxing work. More you clean, more experience you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.poster.avif?t=1766263698\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.webm?t=1766263698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.mp4?t=1766263698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CUSTOMISE YOUR STORE \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With money you earn and experience you get, buy new stuff &amp; customise your store to attract more clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.poster.avif?t=1766263698\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.webm?t=1766263698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.mp4?t=1766263698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to get best performance &amp; look. Gaining experience unlocks getting more performant machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide